ions at Pomona College | Pomona College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Painting is governed by College policies; review current guidance before adding anything.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"pomona-montgomery-music-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Victor Montgomery Music Library","title":"Victor Montgomery Music Library","subtitle":"Thatcher Music Building, Room 209","notes":"Use the study area, listening station, or seminar room for music-focused work, and check the posted library schedule first.","short_summary":"A music library with study seating, computers, listening resources, and space for small groups.","evidence_claim":"Pomona says the Montgomery Music Library has a study area, computer and listening stations, and a seminar room for study groups.","source_url":"https://www.pomona.edu/academics/departments/music/our-facilities/montgomery-music-library","source_title":"Victor Montgomery Music Library | Pomona College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The College notes that hours are subject to change; verify access before heading over.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"pomona-edmunds-ballroom","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Edmunds Ballroom","title":"Edmunds Ballroom","subtitle":"Smith Campus Center event space","notes":"Look for lectures, performances, or campus gatherings scheduled here, and use the room only when an event is open to you.","short_summary":"The Campus Center’s largest configurable venue for dining, audiences, and performances.","evidence_claim":"Pomona describes Edmunds Ballroom as the largest space in Smith Campus Center, with dining, audience, and performance setups.","source_url":"https://www.pomona.edu/a